      "source": "Provide a <a href=\"../QueryRewriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jpa.repository\"><code>QueryRewriter</code></a> based upon the <a href=\"JpaQueryMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jpa.repository.query\"><code>JpaQueryMethod</code></a>. <code>QueryRewriter</code> instances may be\ncontextual or plain objects that are not attached to a bean factory or CDI context.",
